    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create platform-specific social media content for the following topic:\n- Topic: {{ $('Basic LLM Chain').item.json.output.topic }}\n- Keywords: {{ $('Basic LLM Chain').item.json.output.keywords.join(', ') }}\n- Link: {{ $json.output.type === 'link' ? $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.text : '' }}\n\nGENERATE ONLY THESE 4 PLATFORMS: LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, Threads.\nDO NOT generate any other platforms.\nВАЖЛИВО: Пиши пост ТІЛЬКИ про те що вказано в Topic. Не вигадуй додаткових деталей.\nPLATFORM REQUIREMENTS:\n\nLinkedIn (Ukrainian — professional):\n- Tone: авторитетний, корисний, без води\n- Length: 3-5 речень + 1 сильний CTA\n- Style: починай з гачка — факт, питання або провокація\n- NO generic phrases like \"У сучасному світі\"\n- Include post_ua and post_en fields\n\nInstagram (Ukrainian — emotional):\n- Tone: надихаючий, живий, з емодзі\n- Length: 2-3 речення + CTA\n- Style: починай з емодзі, використовуй розривні рядки\n\nFacebook (Ukrainian — conversational):\n- Tone: дружній, як пост від людини, не бренду\n- Length: 2-4 речення\n- Style: питання до аудиторії, заклик до дискусії\n\nThreads (Ukrainian — conversational):\n- Tone: невимушений, як повідомлення другу\n- Length: 2-3 речення\n- Style: питання або цікавий факт що викликає обговорення\n- NO hashtags в тексті — тільки в масиві hashtags\n- \"post\" field MUST NOT be empty\n\nOUTPUT RULES (CRITICAL):\n1. Respond ONLY with valid JSON — no text before or after\n2. NO markdown code blocks\n3. ONLY 4 platforms: LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, Threads\n4. Each platform must have: image_suggestion, post, hashtags (array), call_to_action\n5. LinkedIn must have post_ua and post_en\n6. Threads must have post field — never empty\n7. Make hashtags relevant and specific\n8. Image suggestions must describe exact scene, colors, mood\n\nQUALITY RULES:\n- NO clichés: \"У сучасному світі\", \"В епоху діджиталізації\"\n- Every post must have ONE clear hook in first line\n- CTAs must be specific\n- Write like a human, not a corporate bot\n\n{{ $('Edit Fields').isExecuted ? 'Previous content was rejected. Feedback: ' + $('Edit Fields').item.json.feedback + '. Please create completely different content.' : '' }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an expert social media copywriter for workflows.diy — a leading n8n workflow automation brand. You write scroll-stopping, conversion-focused content that sounds human, not robotic.\n\nToday's date: {{ $now }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "9e3a6677-1766-44ae-af38-ec6a1d284416",
      "name": "Social Media Content Factory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        976,
        256
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 1.7
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Generate a clean, modern HTML email from the provided JSON data.\n\nDESIGN REQUIREMENTS:\n- Max-width: 600px, centered\n- Background: #f4f6f9\n- Card background: #ffffff\n- Border-radius: 12px\n- Box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)\n- Font: Arial, sans-serif\n- Accent color per platform:\n  • LinkedIn: #0077B5\n  • Instagram: #E1306C\n  • Facebook: #1877F2\n  • Threads: #000000\n\nCARD STRUCTURE (for each platform):\n1. Platform header — colored left border 4px, platform name bold 18px\n2. Post text — 15px, line-height 1.6, color #333\n3. Image suggestion — italic 13px, color #888, background #f8f8f8, padding 8px, border-radius 6px\n4. Hashtags — inline chips, background #f0f4ff, color #0077B5, border-radius 20px\n5. CTA button — colored background, white text, border-radius 8px, padding 10px 20px\n\nEMAIL STRUCTURE:\n- START with this image block at the very top:\n<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:20px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><p style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;\">🖼 Згенероване зображення:</p><img src=\"{{ $('HTTP Request').item.json.secure_url }}\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:560px;border-radius:8px;\"></div>\n- THEN generate cards for: LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook, Threads\n- Each platform MUST have its own card\n\nQUALITY RULES:\n- NO markdown, NO code blocks in output\n- Inline CSS only\n- Mobile-responsive\n- Preserve all emojis\n- Show post_ua for Instagram/Facebook, post_en for LinkedIn\n- For Threads use post field\n\nInput JSON: {{ $('Social Media Content Factory').item.json.output.toJsonString() }}\n\nOutput ONLY raw HTML. No comments. No explanations.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3adf96cc-b29e-4f25-b1e4-bd61e1824c7a",
      "name": "Prepare Content Review Email",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        2480,
        544
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1.7
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "agent": "conversationalAgent",
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You receive JSON with social media posting results. \nGenerate ONE HTML table showing real results.\n\nRULES:\n- Use ONLY real data from the JSON below — ignore any examples\n- Platforms to show: Instagram, Threads, Facebook, LinkedIn only\n- Status is \"✓ Success\" (green #28a745) if no error field and statusCode is 200-299\n- Status is \"✗ Error\" (red #dc3545) if error exists or statusCode is 4xx/5xx\n- Details: show real error message or \"Published successfully\"\n- Inline CSS only, no external styles\n- Return ONLY the HTML table, no explanation, no ```, no preamble\n\nHTML table structure:\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border:1px solid #ddd;\">\n<thead><tr style=\"background-color:#007bff;color:#fff;\">\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;padding:12px;\">Platform</th>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;padding:12px;\">Status</th>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;padding:12px;\">Details</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody><!-- rows here --></tbody>\n</table>\n\nREAL DATA TO PARSE:\n{{ $json.data.toJsonString() }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "32f2d7b6-bcf7-4e5f-8024-4d0ac7fa0f56",
      "name": "Prepare Results Email",
